From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] shell32: IShellItem2 properties and property stores (3600)

shell32: IShellItem2 properties and property stores

GetProperty, GetString, GetUInt32, GetUInt64, GetInt32, GetBool, GetCLSID
and GetFileTime answer the item's name, path, extension, type, attributes,
size and dates (file system items) and otherwise ask the parent folder's
GetDetailsEx. GetPropertyStore, GetPropertyStoreForKeys and
GetPropertyStoreWithCreateObject return a read-only store of those values;
Update succeeds. shell32 delay-imports propsys.

Rebased at integration (integ-2026-10) onto 3258 (fast-a): IShellItem2::GetPropertyStore merged: GPS_TEMPORARY gives 3258's temporary store, everything else 3600's read-only store; propsys delay import kept once.
---
